%% V02 Test Seq 04
%% Concrete DnD unlock: Great Weapon Master bonus attack on kill.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor FighterUI as FighterSeren UI
  participant Transport as WS/REST Handler
  participant Service as ActionExecutionApplicationService
  participant RollPolicy as Manual Roll Policy
  participant Exec as OutcomeExecutionStage
  participant Unlock as Outcome Listener / Unlock Policy
  participant Budget as TurnBudgetRuntime
  participant Events as Event Publisher

  Note over FighterUI,Service: Encounter setup\nFighterSeren Greatsword attack modifier 8, damage 2d6 plus 4\nFeat Great Weapon Master bonus attack on crit or kill\nGoblinA AC 15 HP 7, GoblinB AC 15 HP 14

  FighterUI->>Transport: execute_action req-2301 action.weapon_attack.greatsword target GoblinA
  Transport->>Service: execute_action(command)
  Note over Service: Internal trace only: stage lifecycle and per-operation planning
  Service->>Exec: roll attack d20 20 critical hit
  Service->>RollPolicy: evaluate manual damage roll mode for critical greatsword damage
  RollPolicy-->>Service: requires_pending_roll
  Service-->>Transport: ActionExecutionOutcome status pending_roll with roll_context formula 4d6 plus 4
  Transport-->>FighterUI: pending_roll prompt for critical damage entry
  FighterUI->>Transport: continue_action req-2301 submitted_roll total 22 dice 6 4 5 3 modifier 4
  Transport->>Service: resume_from_roll req-2301
  Service->>Exec: validate submitted roll bounds and apply critical damage total 22 slashing
  Exec-->>Service: GoblinA HP from 7 to 0, actor_died true

  Service->>Unlock: evaluate unlock triggers from outcomes
  alt Unlock condition matched (GWM kill/crit)
    Unlock->>Budget: add feat.gwm.cleave_attack to unlocked_action_refs
    Budget-->>Service: updated turn budget snapshot
    Service->>Events: turn_budget_updated with unlocked_action_refs included
    Events-->>FighterUI: contextual unlocked action becomes available
  else No unlock condition
    Unlock-->>Service: no mutation
  end

  Service->>Events: attack_result critical hit on GoblinA
  Service->>Events: actor_damaged GoblinA amount 22 slashing
  Service->>Events: terminal_action_result for req-2301
  Events-->>FighterUI: resolved

  opt Player spends unlocked action on GoblinB
    FighterUI->>Transport: execute_action req-2302 action_ref feat.gwm.cleave_attack target GoblinB
    Transport->>Service: execute_action(command)
    Service->>Exec: roll attack d20 13, total 21 vs AC 15 hit
    Service->>RollPolicy: evaluate manual damage roll mode for follow-up attack
    RollPolicy-->>Service: requires_pending_roll
    Service-->>Transport: ActionExecutionOutcome status pending_roll with roll_context formula 2d6 plus 4
    Transport-->>FighterUI: pending_roll prompt for follow-up damage entry
    FighterUI->>Transport: continue_action req-2302 submitted_roll total 14 dice 4 6 modifier 4
    Transport->>Service: resume_from_roll req-2302
    Service->>Exec: validate submitted roll bounds and apply follow-up damage total 14 slashing
    Exec-->>Service: GoblinB HP from 14 to 0
    Service->>Events: attack_result hit on GoblinB
    Service->>Events: actor_damaged GoblinB amount 14 slashing
    Service->>Events: terminal_action_result for req-2302
    Events-->>FighterUI: resolved
  end

  Note over Unlock,Budget: Assertions\n1. Unlock mutation is event-driven from kill or crit outcome\n2. Unlock updates budget availability, not auto-execution\n3. Follow-up action is separate atomic request req-2302\n4. Pending_roll is emitted for both damage nodes and validated before apply
